"Ha`nh ddo^.ng ba.n ye^u ca^`u ca^`n ma^.t kha^?u root . Xin nha^.p ma^.t"
"kha^?u root du+o+'i dda^y hoa(.c nha^'n bo? qua dde^? tie^'p tu.c"
"vo+'i quye^`n hie^.n ta.i ."

#: sudlg.cpp:29
msgid ""
"The action you requested needs additional privileges. Please enter the "
